"يجب تعديل خصائص التأثير :guilabel:`Start` و/أو :guilabel:`End`."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:366
msgid ""
"*NOTE: Most effects in OpenShot default the effect duration to the clip "
